    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the website data below for a Business Finder system.\n\nYour job is to identify the business and evaluate its potential for AI and automation services.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. Do not include markdown, explanations, or code fences.\n\nUse exactly this structure:\n\n{\n  \"business_name\": \"\",\n  \"industry\": \"\",\n  \"website\": \"\",\n  \"overall_score\": 0,\n  \"opportunity_1\": \"\",\n  \"opportunity_2\": \"\",\n  \"opportunity_3\": \"\",\n  \"opportunity_4\": \"\",\n  \"opportunity_5\": \"\"\n}\n\nRules:\n\n- business_name: identify the business or organization from the website.\n- industry: identify the most appropriate industry.\n- website: use the website URL provided in the data.\n- overall_score: score the business from 0 to 100 based on its potential need for AI, automation, lead generation, customer service automation, internal workflow automation, or similar business automation.\n- opportunity_1 through opportunity_5: provide five specific and realistic AI/automation opportunities for this business.\n- Rank the opportunities from highest potential value to lowest.\n- Avoid generic suggestions. Base the opportunities on the actual website content.\n- If an item cannot be determined reliably, use an empty string.\n\nWebsite data:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        576,
        -432
      ],
      "id": "06dfd482-6b43-4376-8876-6dd7788037db",
